The '''Desert''' is an island in the [[First Sea]].

==Appearance==
The Desert is covered almost entirely in sand, except for a few paths and courtyards. From the docks, the player will find a pathway leading to a village full of [[Desert Bandit]]s. Going from the other path, the player will pass a dilapidated house and a pyramid with a [[Chests|Silver Chest]] in front of it, the path leads to a bridge leading to another section with a set of houses along with the [[Desert Officer]]s.

