==Saber Expert Puzzle==
The Desert also has the continuation of the [[Saber/Puzzle|Saber Expert Puzzle]]. In the fallen house, there will be curtains that can be burnt down with the torch the player collects at [[Jungle]], and they will see a riddle and a cup, after which the player will need to take the cup and go to [[Frozen Village]].

== Secret Quests ==

* The player must enter the pyramid through a passage located beneath the Silver Chest. Inside the pyramid, they must defeat the skeleton attacking the NPC [[Hasan]]. Three additional skeletons will then emerge from the tombs one at a time and must also be defeated. Finally, the player must speak to the Desert Merchant to complete the quest.
* The player must go to the area next to the pyramid, where they will find a circle of stones covered in sand. The player must hit the stones with a fighting style or sword to remove the sand covering it. The stones will then rise and begin rotating, causing a platform beneath the player to rise. Once this is complete, the player must return to the Desert Adventurer to complete the quest.
* The player must destroy 10 blooming cacti by hitting them then talk to the desert merchant, Cacti will be blooming at random after a few hours in a server. On completion on the quest , the player is awarded a desert juice

==Trivia==
* The [[Soundtracks|theme]] that plays at the Desert is The Endless Desert.
* The Desert is the only desert-themed island in the entire game.
* If the player collects the [[Chests|Silver Chest]] near the pyramid, there is a secret passage under it that leads to [[Hasan]] from whom the player can buy the [[Swordsman Hat]].
* [[Light]]'s [[Raids|raid]] islands are based on the Desert.
* The Desert was one of few islands that does not have a [[Luxury Boat Dealer]] before Update 30, deleting all of them and putting the [[Fast Boats]] on the normal Boat dealer.

